{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person parkour game made by individual developers, you need to escape the enemy's pursuit, then use the terrain to stomp and kill them, surviving wave after wave of offensives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will actively listen to feedback on Bilibili, if you have good suggestions, please feel free to contact me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.poster.avif?t=1760170776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.webm?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.mp4?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Chases!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront enemies with extremely fast moving speeds, avoid their attacks, and try every means to kill them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/753a7adbbe4412ee7b9e519c5bd22cf2.poster.avif?t=1760170776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/753a7adbbe4412ee7b9e519c5bd22cf2.webm?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/753a7adbbe4412ee7b9e519c5bd22cf2.mp4?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Silky Parkour, Kill in One Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can kill the enemy cleanly, you will also smash the keyboard due to your own mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.poster.avif?t=1760170776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.webm?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.mp4?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wardrobe System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decide what you wear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/8a717a82718bde62a8c471577cf3ff9c.poster.avif?t=1760170776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/8a717a82718bde62a8c471577cf3ff9c.webm?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Master of Killing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn game skills and master the killing methods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/9dd6433f86e3a8bc7e1d774a7c0e5338.poster.avif?t=1760170776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/9dd6433f86e3a8bc7e1d774a7c0e5338.webm?t=1760170776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004130/extras/9dd643